          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Horde Lord Adora has taken over Etheria, bringing chaos and fear onto the world. Catra is a part of the Rebellion, with an intend to finish this war. And Adora.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What happens when her plan changes? When they are starting to see each other as more than just enemies? Will Adora be able to change her way of being or will she go down during a revolution? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Will Adora be able to turn her darkness into light?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
